@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Risk-Aware Verification — Evidence Before PASS

rectangle "Acceptance Criteria\n→ evidence matrix" as acceptance
rectangle "Focused tests\nStatic / unit / component" as focused
rectangle "Mandatory risk dimensions\nBoundary / negative / integration\nRegression / property / mutation / E2E" as risk
rectangle "Failure/error contract\nFormat / structure / semantics\nCaller-consumable response" as failure_contract
rectangle "Real boundary evidence\nURL / proxy / TLS\nHeaders / cookies / cache" as real_boundary
rectangle "Isolation / flaky check\nRetry ≠ PASS" as isolation
rectangle "TEST QUALITY GATE" as gate

acceptance --> focused : map scenarios
acceptance --> risk : select applicable dimensions
acceptance --> failure_contract : public-boundary failures
acceptance --> real_boundary : entry/config/client rules
acceptance --> isolation : assess repeatability
focused --> gate : executed evidence
risk --> gate : evidence / justified N/A
failure_contract --> gate : not just occurrence
real_boundary --> gate : real path evidence
isolation --> gate : no unexplained flakiness

note bottom of gate
  PASS requires evidence for every acceptance criterion
  and every mandatory risk dimension, including
  caller-consumable failure/error contracts and
  real entrypoint/config evidence when relevant.
end note
@enduml
